data: {"id": "98daf503864d47e6-thinking-parallel_evidence-523", "run_id": "98daf503864d47e6", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "TodoWrite", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=384 lines=7\nInvestigation plan updated with 3 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 0 completed, 1 in progress, 2 pending\n[ ] [2] 执行 kubectl_get_yaml 获取 Pod 规", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789048458427, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_3e02b02861f4412b862b97d9", "tool_sequence": 1, "semantic_success": true, "result": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=384 lines=7\nInvestigation plan updated with 3 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 0 completed, 1 in progress, 2 pending\n[ ] [2] 执行 kubectl_get_yaml 获取 Pod 规格（镜像、卷、调度节点），与 Events 对照\n[ ] [3] 综合 Events、Metrics 和 Spec 判断根因（ImagePull / Sandbox / Volume）\n[~] [1] 执行 kubectl_describe pod 获取容器状态、Events 和异常事件原文\n**Instructions**: Use TodoWrite tool to update task status as you work.", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/98daf503864d47e6-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/98daf503864d47e6-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/98daf503864d47e6-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.summary.txt"}

